  "",
  "As the front lines contracted,",
  "one man defied that order",
  "and sent troops far and wide.",
  "His name was Dozle.",
  "A Zabi who, for whatever reason,",
  "has long been called the third son.",
  "His only older brother",
  "was the eldest, Gihren,",
  "and then only his sister Kycilia,",
  "so, truly,",
  "it can only be called a mystery.",
  "Perhaps an unknown second son",
  "died young, or ran away.",
  "And this Dozle spread his troops",
  "as if ignoring all of Zeon's orders.",
  "This, at a time when Zeon's",
  "vital supply base, Solomon,",
  "needed troops to defend it,",
  "no less.",
  "And why?",
  "Because he had",
  "found White Base.",
  "Dozle's Blunder",
  "Amuro's Awakening",
  "Dozle was a bold,",
  "open-hearted man of feeling.",
  "Boisterous, but deeply kind.",
  "So, like Degwin, he doted purely",
  "on his younger brother Garma,",
  "and when Garma died, the first",
  "to think of revenge",
  "was this man.",
  "This was a man who",
  "often put feeling before orders.",
  "So it was this time, too:",
  "the moment he found White Base,",
  "he sent out troops at once.",
  "At this point, White Base",
  "had fulfilled its role",
  "as a decoy.",
  "And that became",
  "Dozle's greatest blunder.",
  "He would later say, 'Rather than",
  "one Big Zam, send ten Doms,'",
  "yet he lost more than ten",
  "in this very battle.",
  "Amuro was already superhuman,",
  "but it was from about here on that",
  "he became truly superhuman.",
  "I wrote earlier that Matilda's death",
  "and his grief at not protecting her",
  "made him stronger.",
  "That always makes him stronger.",
  "So here too, it is fair to say,",
  "he lost someone.",
  "What he lost this time",
  "was his father, and because of it",
  "he would grow stronger still.",
  "When he failed to protect",
  "what mattered, he grew stronger",
  "so it would not happen again.",
  "On this day, White Base",
  "reached Side 6.",
  "Within neutral Side 6's territory,",
  "Earth Federation Forces",
  "and Zeon forces alike",
  "were barred from",
  "all acts of war.",
  "Amuro",
  "\"Sayla-san, how's it look?",
  " Nothing unusual, right?\"",
  "Sayla",
  "\"Kai, can you hear me? Anything?\"",
  "Kai",
  "\"All clear.",
  " This thing's got short legs,",
  " so I'm pullin' back.\"",
  "\"The Core Booster will keep",
  " patrolling a little longer.",
  " Is that all right?\"",
  "\"That's fine.",
  " For me, it's good",
  " navigation practice.\"",
  "\"Say, Amuro,",
  " what do you think",
  " of Fraw Bow?\"",
  "\"Huh? W-why do you ask?\"",
  "\"Why? Because lately you've",
  " been cold to Fraw Bow.\"",
  "\"That's not true.\"",
  "\"Isn't it?",
  " At times like these, friendship",
  " matters all the more.\"",
  "\"It's not like I hate her now...\"",
  "Meanwhile...",
  "Aboard White Base",
  "Bright",
  "\"Understood. You can come back.",
  " Even Char can't follow us",
  " all the way to Side 6...\"",
  "\"Thank you for coming.\"",
  "Kamaran",
  "\"I'm the Side 6 inspector,",
  " Kamaran Bloom.\"",
  "\"I've sealed White Base's",
  " missile ports, cannons and",
  " beam cannons with paper.\"",
  "\"If even one of these is torn...\"",
  "\"I know.",
  " We'd have to pay",
  " a heavy fine.\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"What I want to ask about",
  " is repairs to the ship--\"",
  "\"That can't be done",
  " inside Side 6 either.",
  " It all counts as aiding the war.\"",
  "\"Understood.\"",
  "\"Good timing.",
  " We're just entering port.",
  " Would you like to see the bridge?\"",
  "\"Er, well...\"",
  "Mirai",
  "\"Approach angle good,",
  " docking speed zero, five.\"",
  "Marker",
  "\"Entering Side 6's Palda Bay.",
  " All hands, prepare to moor.\"",
  "\"360-degree laser sensors,",
  " open.\"",
  "\"...Mirai? Mirai, is that you?\"",
  "\"K-Kamaran, you...\"",
  "\"...Mirai,",
  " you're alive, you're alive...",
  " M-Mirai.\"",
  "\"...And you look well.\"",
  "Katz",
  "\"Huh?\"",
  "\"Who could that be?\"",
  "Fraw",
  "\"Isn't he a relative?\"",
  "\"Inspector Kamaran, we're docking.",
  " Please hold off.\"",
  "\"You too, Ensign Mirai.\"",
  "\"Ah, y-yes, Lieutenant, sorry.\"",
  "\"Mirai.\"",
  "\"Yes.\"",
  "\"Oh, but Mirai,",
  " I'm just so happy, that's all.\"",
  "\"I'd given up hope of",
  " ever seeing you again.\"",
  "\"And then came this war.",
  " If your father hadn't died,",
  " even the war...\"",
  "\"...\"",
  "(Bright will give me an earful",
