  "\"Yes...",
  " maybe I'd never have emigrated",
  " to Side 7, either.\"",
  "\"That's just it. Why didn't you",
  " let me know about that?",
  " Mirai?\"",
  "\"I was desperate",
  " to hear any news of you.\"",
  "\"Desperate?\"",
  "\"Yes, I had people search hard.",
  " I can't even tell you",
  " how much it cost.\"",
  "\"I see.",
  " Then why didn't you",
  " search for me yourself?\"",
  "\"Because I was just about",
  " to move here to Side 6.\"",
  "\"In the end, it was only a",
  " marriage our parents arranged.\"",
  "\"N-no, that's not it, Mirai.",
  " You've got it all wrong.\"",
  "\"Won't you come to my home now?",
  " My father would be delighted.\"",
  "\"What? But...\"",
  "\"I'll see you're treated well.",
  " Mirai, for your sake I'd go",
  " to any lengths at all.\"",
  "\"W-wait a moment.\"",
  "Sleggar",
  "\"Pardon me.\"",
  "\"Hm? Ah!\"",
  "\"Don't care if you're an inspector,",
  " you're in the way. Get out.\"",
  "\"Sleggar-san!\"",
