  "\"We don't need you makin'",
  " clumsy passes around here.\"",
  "\"Lieutenant Sleggar,",
  " i-it's all right.\"",
  "\"Is that so?\"",
  "\"Hmm.\"",
  "\"Ya hear that, pretty boy?\"",
  "\"...Ah.\"",
  "\"Kamaran, are you all right?\"",
  "\"Ah, yes.",
  " Same old story: his way of",
  " courting a lady's just clumsy.\"",
  "\"Ain't that right, Lieutenant?\"",
  "\"That's about it.\"",
  "\"After all, Ensign Mirai",
  " is White Base's",
  " own mother hen.\"",
  "\"Try anything, and a whole lotta",
  " lieutenants'll deal with ya. Eh?\"",
  "\"...We're in port! Get to work!\"",
  "Dozle, it is said, was overjoyed",
  "to find White Base,",
  "his brother Garma's killer.",
  "And he sent in the nearby",
  "Dren and Conscon units.",
  "A great army moving for one man's",
  "revenge: being able to do that",
  "was the very essence",
  "of dictatorship,",
  "and yet in the end, no one",
  "ever raised an objection.",
  "Char had made contact",
  "with Conscon.",
  "Not by choice.",
  "He had been summoned.",
  "Among Dozle's officers, Conscon",
  "was rumored to be the most",
  "political of them all.",
  "Aboard the Chivvay",
  "Conscon",
  "\"You served Vice Admiral Dozle,",
  " now Rear Admiral Kycilia?\"",
  "\"Aren't you ashamed",
  " of yourself?\"",
  "\"Lose the Trojan Horse often?\"",
  "\"Honestly.",
  " I'll show you how it's done,",
  " so watch closely.\"",
  "Char",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"Who said you could leave?\"",
  "\"Please don't bully",
  " the young.",
  " I'll be watching your handiwork.\"",
  "\"Why does he never",
  " take off that mask?\"",
  "Zeon Soldier",
  "\"Something about bad burns.",
  " Rumor says he's handsome, too.\"",
  "\"Someday I'll tear off",
  " that mask of his.\"",
  "\"And the Rick Doms that slipped",
  " in around Palda Bay?\"",
  "\"Sir, so far it seems",
  " even Side 6 patrol boats",
  " haven't spotted them.\"",
  "\"Good.\"",
  "Launch",
  "\"Entering Side 6.\"",
  "\"Once aboard the Zanzibar, send",
  " Rear Admiral Kycilia a coded wire.\"",
  "\"Paralomz Char.",
  " Understood?\"",
  "\"That's all?\"",
  "\"Don't ask anything more.",
  " It's top secret.\"",
  "\"But the Conscon unit...",
  " is it really all right",
  " to leave them be?\"",
  "\"It can't be helped.",
  " Vice Admiral Dozle and Conscon",
  " see only the enemy before them.\"",
  "\"Lady Kycilia is different.",
  " She sees where the war",
  " as a whole is heading.\"",
  "\"What is there?",
  " In Side 6?\"",
  "\"It's been resting here, as it is.",
  " It will see real combat soon.",
  " You'll understand then.\"",
  "\"We're entering port.\"",
  "\"Colonel Char's Zanzibar",
  " is entering port at Side 6.\"",
  "\"Char, eh. Hmph,",
  " always doing as he pleases.\"",
  "White Base Bridge",
  "\"Whoa, now that's a surprise.\"",
  "\"Sharing a port with the enemy...",
  " a sight unique to a neutral Side.\"",
  "\"It's a cartoon, a total cartoon.\"",
  "\"Why don't we just",
  " invite the enemy over here",
  " and throw a party? Eh?\"",
  "\"Heh. Why not.\"",
  "Hayato",
  "\"Ugh... I-I can't forgive them.\"",
  "\"Where are you going?\"",
  "\"Wh-where?",
  " The enemy who killed Ryu-san",
  " is right in front of us!\"",
  "\"Hayato, even you must know",
  " what would become of us if we",
  " fought here in this Side.\"",
  "\"But...\"",
  "\"We leave port soon.",
  " No one goes ashore.\"",
  "\"There's a mountain of work",
  " to do maintaining White Base.",
  " Everyone, to your stations now.\"",
  "\"Damn it.\"",
  "\"Kamaran's gone over to",
  " the Zeon ship this time.\"",
  "\"He has to treat",
  " both sides equally, I guess.\"",
  "Zanzibar Bridge",
  "\"I trust there will be no change",
  " to the length of your stay.\"",
  "\"I understand.\"",
  "\"As for sealing your weapons...\"",
  "\"I believe I'm aware of that.\"",
  "\"Then please don't stir up",
  " any trouble with the Federation.\"",
  "\"I've told my men. Good day.\"",
  "Inside Side 6",
  "Even after docking,",
  "White Base's crew",
  "was given no free time,",
  "but there was one exception.",
  "Amuro.",
  "Born with a love of machines,",
  "and with a face that",
  "looked nothing like a soldier's,",
  "he had been sent to buy civilian",
  "machine parts for the repairs.",
  "Busy with battle, he had just then",
  "been out of step with Fraw, too.",
  "To him,",
  "it was meant as a nice break.",
  "\"Ah!\"",
  "\"...D-Dad.\"",
  "\"Dad!\"",
  "\"...\"",
  "Tem",
  "\"Oh, Amuro, is it?\"",
  "\"...Dad.",
  " You're alive, you're alive.",
  " Why didn't you contact--\"",
  "\"How's the Gundam doing in battle?",
  " All going well?\"",
  "\"...Y-yes, Dad.\"",
  "\"Good. Come along.\"",
  "\"Y-yes, sir.\"",
  "Junk Shop",
  "\"Well, what are you doing?",
  " Come in, come in.\"",
  "\"Wh-what is this place?\"",
  "\"A junk shop is a handy place",
  " for gathering information.\"",
  "\"They're letting me",
  " live in here.\"",
  "\"Attach this to the Gundam's",
  " recording circuit.\"",
  "\"I developed it based on",
  " Zeon mobile suit circuits.\"",
  "(S-something this old? Dad, your",
  " mind... oxygen deprivation...)",
  "\"Splendid. The Gundam's power will",
  " leap several times over.\"",
  "\"Take it,",
  " then install and test it at once.\"",
  "\"Hehehehe. Ahahahaha!\"",
  "\"Okay. But what about you, Dad?\"",
  "\"I've got lots of research going.",
  " I'll be in touch.",
  " Now, off you go.\"",
  "\"Uh-huh.\"",
  "\"Dad,",
  " I saw Mom back home.\"",
  " Don't you even care about Mom?\"",
  "\"Hm? Mm.",
  " The war will be over soon.",
  " Then let's go down to Earth.\"",
  "\"After my research is done, mind.\"",
  "\"Dad...\"",
  "\"Hurry up. You've become",
  " a soldier too, haven't you?\"",
  "In the end, Amuro",
  "fled from his father",
  "without a word.",
  "He simply cried.",
  "Forgetting everything.",
  "He came back to himself",
  "only after a girl he did not know",
  "had held him in her arms.",
  "Lalah",
  "\"You poor thing.\"",
  "\"Wha--!\"",
  "\"I'm sorry.",
  " I didn't mean to startle you.\"",
  "\"Ah, uh, no,",
  " it's just, it was a first for me.\"",
  "\"...You have such beautiful eyes.\"",
  "\"R-really? You think so?\"",
  "\"Lalah.",
  " So there you were.\"",
  "\"Sorry about that, young man.",
  " She is a rather unusual girl.\"",
  "\"N-no, it was nothing.\"",
  "\"I'm sorry.\"",
  "\"Ah, no... huh?\"",
  "\"Is something wrong with me?\"",
  "\"Ah...\"",
  "\"And you are?\"",
  "\"A-Amuro...",
  " Amuro Ray.\"",
  "\"Amuro?",
  " Strange... it sounds like",
  " a name I know.\"",
  "(Y-yes, I do know.",
  " I know who you are.)",
  "\"Sorry.",
  " Um, may I ask your name?\"",
  "\"Char Aznable.",
  " A soldier, as you can see.\"",
  "(Char.)",
  "\"Lalah, start the car.",
  " Quietly, now.\"",
  "\"Yes, Colonel.\"",
  "(So that's Char.",
  " Char Aznable, he said.)",
  "\"Slowly, all right?",
  " Lalah.\"",
  "\"What is it? Back, Amuro-kun.\"",
  "(I've only just met him,",
  " so how did I know he was Char?)",
  "(And that girl...",
  " Lalah, he called her?)",
  "\"How old are you?\"",
  "\"...S-sixteen.\"",
  "\"I see. You're young.\"",
  "\"I understand being tense",
  " with an enemy soldier there,\"",
  "\"but the least you could do",
  " is thank me, Amuro-kun.\"",
  "\"...N-no, um,",
  " th-thank you very much.",
  " Well, I'll be going.\"",
  "\"What's wrong with that boy?\"",
  "\"Because he knows",
  " your name, Colonel, I suppose.",
  " Char the Red Comet.\"",
  "\"He was scared, I'm sure.\"",
  "\"What did you do?\"",
  "\"He was troubled",
  " about his father.",
  " So I helped him awaken.\"",
  "\"You seem in good spirits.\"",
  "\"Well, he was more amazing",
  " than anyone I ever saw",
  " at the Flanagan Institute.\"",
  "\"Amuro,",
  " I don't recall giving you time",
  " to wander around town.\"",
  "\"You've delayed our departure.\"",
  "\"S-sorry.",
  " But leaving port so suddenly...\"",
  "\"You're going out in the Gundam",
  " to escort White Base.\"",
  "\"Pergamino-san.\"",
  "Pergamino",
  "\"Was this really",
  " at Inspector Kamaran Bloom's",
  " request?\"",
  "\"Ah, it was a videophone call",
  " from the Prime Minister's office.",
  " No mistake about it, none.\"",
  "\"At docks outside the territory,",
  " Zeon ship or Federation ship,",
  " I get to fix them all.\"",
  "\"We're being pursued.",
  " Will that be all right?\"",
  "\"Oh, I've got connections",
  " with the bigwigs on both sides.\"",
  "\"Young lady,",
  " please set your mind at ease.\"",
  "\"Thank you, Pergamino-san.\"",
  "\"Hey, Amuro,",
  " feelin' a bit better?\"",
  "\"I've been fine all along.\"",
  "\"That so? Then that's fine.",
  " Good boy.\"",
  "\"Sleggar-san.\"",
  "\"What is it?\"",
  "\"That 'good boy' stuff...",
  " could you stop it?\"",
  "\"...Hahahaha!",
  " Sorry, my bad.\"",
  "\"So what got you back on",
  " your feet... a girl?\"",
  "\"I don't like",
  " that kind of talk.\"",
  "\"A signal flare's gone up.\"",
  "\"It's the signal: the Trojan Horse",
  " has left Side 6's space.\"",
  "\"Confirm position. Full engines.\"",
  "\"Why'd they come out",
  " so early? Blasted Trojan Horse.\"",
  "\"Understood.",
  " It's where Pergamino's",
  " floating dock is.\"",
  "\"Pergamino? The one making",
  " a killing off the war?\"",
  "\"Perfect. That puts our fleet in",
  " a straight line with the enemy.",
  " Launch 12 Rick Doms.\"",
  "\"D-damn it, a trap!?\"",
  "\"Ahhh, m-my dock!\"",
  "\"Bright,",
  " Kamaran isn't that kind of man.\"",
  "\"...Sorry.\"",
  "\"Hard to starboard.\"",
  "\"...Lieutenant, p-please",
  " move away from the dock.\"",
  "\"...That way",
  " my dock will be saved.\"",
  "\"That's what I'm doing!\"",
  "\"The Rick Doms, launched yet?\"",
  "\"They should be ready by now.\"",
  "\"The Trojan Horse is turning to",
  " escape the opposite way.\"",
  "\"Launch the Rick Doms!",
  " Never mind the territory.",
  " The battle's outside it anyway.\"",
  "\"Like hell I'll be scorned",
  " by a whelp like Char.\"",
  "\"All right, Dom team,",
  " begin the attack.\"",
  "\"Open the hatch.",
  " Launch the Gundam, hurry!\"",
  "\"Launching!\"",
  "\"White Base, maximum battle speed.",
  " Engaging in anti-air combat.\"",
  "\"Mega beam cannons,",
  " don't fire on the ships yet.",
  " The beams would hit Side 6.\"",
  "\"W-wiped out?",
  " Twelve Rick Doms wiped out?",
  " In under three minutes?\"",
  "\"Tw-twelve Rick Doms,",
  " against one damaged warship?\"",
  "\"Is it a m-monster...?",
  " Th-this is absurd.\"",
  "\"B-bogged down this much",
  " by one Trojan Horse...\"",
  "\"Ch-Char is watching,",
  " Char!\"",
  "\"Ram them!",
  " Smash this Chivvay right into",
  " the Trojan Horse's gut!!\"",
  "Reporter",
  "\"A Musai-type is down, and",
  " heavy cruiser Chivvay advances.\"",
  "\"Not a single mobile suit",
  " can be seen now.\"",
  "\"How this battle",
  " will unfold",
  " is now completely unclear.\"",
  "\"The white mobile suit will win.\"",
  "\"Hm?",
  " The Gundam isn't on screen.\"",
  "\"I can tell. It's that boy.\"",
  "\"Besides...\"",
  "\"Isn't that why you took in",
  " a woman like me,",
  " Colonel?\"",
  "\"Heh heh. Lalah, you're clever.\"",
  "\"Hehehe.\"",
  "\"Heavy cruiser Chivvay has sunk.",
  " It seems the Federation has won.\"",
  "\"See, Colonel?\"",
  "\"A Newtype...",
  " the genuine article, it seems.\""
 ]
